{"id":"9394","name":"Helios DEX","address":"elysium:0x875e0130b52404c75f594ea8451597dd16c6b6e4","symbol":"HELIOS","url":"","description":"Helios is a liquidity platform on Elysium. Its DLMM (bin) and DAMM (full range) pools are Uniswap v4 pools with the Helios fee hook: a launch fee that steps down, a fee that rises with volatility, and a tax on sandwich bots. Its app also opens and manages liquidity positions in other Elysium DEXes' pools.","chain":"Elysium Kinetiq","logo":"https://icons.llamao.fi/icons/protocols/helios-dex","audits":"2","gecko_id":null,"cmcId":null,"tags":["Hook-based AMM"],"chains":["Elysium Kinetiq"],"module":"heliosliq/index.js","twitter":"heliosliq","listedAt":1794358915,"dimensions":{"fees":"heliosliq","dexs":"heliosliq"},"category":"Dexs","methodology":"Counts the liquidity in Helios DLMM and DAMM pools: the Uniswap v4 pools that carry the Helios fee hook. Pools are found from the PoolManager's Initialize events and their reserves are rebuilt on chain from tick liquidity and the current price via StateView. The pools sit in the Uniswap v4 PoolManager, so the TVL is double counted with Uniswap v4.","tvlCodePath":"https://github.com/DefiLlama/DefiLlama-Adapters/blob/main/projects/heliosliq/index.js","chainTvls":{"Elysium Kinetiq":{"tvl":[{"date":1794355200,"totalLiquidityUSD":11690},{"date":1794441600,"totalLiquidityUSD":2649},{"date":1794441887,"totalLiquidityUSD":2649}],"tokensInUsd":[{"date":1794355200,"tokens":{"HYPE":5274.70053,"E/ACC":8.78401,"VOLTA":0.04809,"USDC":15.12546,"BOXA":6391.93535}},{"date":1794441600,"tokens":{"USDC":14.21065,"HYPE":2409.40999,"E/ACC":3.08218,"VOLTA":0.03544,"BOXA":222.50974}},{"date":1794441887,"tokens":{"USDC":14.21065,"HYPE":2409.40999,"E/ACC":3.08218,"VOLTA":0.03544,"BOXA":222.50974}}],"tokens":[{"date":1794355200,"tokens":{"HYPE":73.54538,"E/ACC":1758.54474,"VOLTA":20.6163,"USDC":15.12768,"BOXA":6095652.319}},{"date":1794441600,"tokens":{"USDC":14.21315,"HYPE":33.56112,"E/ACC":6489.09421,"VOLTA":31.99494